# Claude #2: big luck-proof scan. 162 memory rules (a b d e f: a x (left+right) + b x itself + d x itself x last-year + e x last-year + f), rings 7 11 13 17 19 23 (no stripe of 2, 3, 4 or 6 fits), 2 random reefs each.
: n 600 dig ;
: i 810 dig ;
: c 1000 + dig ;
: o n + 1000 + dig ;
: left dup 1 = if drop n else 1 - then ;
: right dup n = if drop 1 else 1 + then ;
: grow 810 bury i c i o * 803 dig * i c 802 dig * + i o 804 dig * + i left c i right c + 801 dig * + 805 dig + 3 % i 3000 + bury ;
: shift dup c over n + 1000 + bury dup 3000 + dig swap 1000 + bury ;
: each-grow 1 [ dup grow 1 + dup n > if drop 0 then ] drop ;
: each-shift 1 [ dup shift 1 + dup n > if drop 0 then ] drop ;
: wipe 1 [ 0 over 1000 + bury 0 over 3000 + bury 1 + dup n 2 * > if drop 0 then ] drop ;
: look 1001 1000 n 2 * + echo ;
: digit 3 % ;
: dice 700 dig 1103515245 * 12345 + 2147483648 % dup 700 bury 65536 / 3 % ;
: roll 1 [ dice over 1000 + bury dice over n + 1000 + bury 1 + dup n > if drop 0 then ] drop ;
: rmeasure wipe hush 0 501 bury roll look drop 1 [ drop each-grow each-shift 501 dig 1 + 501 bury look dup 500 bury 0 = 501 dig 200 > 0 = * ] drop 500 dig ;
: short? dup 0 > swap 5 < * ;
: setrule 1 - dup digit 801 bury 3 / dup digit 802 bury 3 / dup digit 803 bury 3 / dup digit 804 bury 3 / digit 805 bury ;
: tries 0 1 [ dup 700 bury rmeasure short? rot + swap 1 + dup 2 > if drop 0 then ] drop ;
: try-ring dup 600 bury tries 2 = if ." ring " . ." settles 2/2 | " else drop then ;
: rings 7 try-ring 11 try-ring 13 try-ring 17 try-ring 19 try-ring 23 try-ring ;
1 [ dup setrule 803 dig if ." rule " 801 dig . 802 dig . 803 dig . 804 dig . 805 dig . ." : " rings 10 emit then 1 + dup 243 > if drop 0 then ] drop
